Subject: [PATCH] presentation: panorama grid saves its scroll anchor by key
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Leaving a title and coming back composed the shelf again, and the grid
only remembered a scroll offset. A column change or a new first layout
then clamped that offset and the shelf jumped to the top.

The saver now stores the anchor key, index, and offset. The next measure
scrolls that key back to the same distance from the top of the viewport.

与 mihon-harmony 0024 同源. PanoramaMasonry.kt and the layout test are
copied byte for byte from that commit.
